# The committed registry snapshot. `pnpm registry:sync` emits it as
# `JSON.stringify(payload, null, 2)`, and `registry:verify` compares that output
# byte-for-byte against the file. Prettier reformats it differently, so with
# both active `format:check` and `registry:verify` cannot pass at the same time.
# It is generated and never hand-edited (CLAUDE.md §6.1), so the generator owns
# its formatting — the same reasoning as `components/ui/` below.
registry.json

# Extracted doctrine — `pnpm doctrine:extract` emits these from Supabase and
# `doctrine:verify` compares its output byte-for-byte against the files. Prettier
# reformats YAML frontmatter and reflows MDX prose, so with both active the drift
# gate cannot pass. The generator owns the formatting — same reasoning as
# `registry.json` above. See CLAUDE.md §15.17.
content/doctrine/

# Author-time skills for working on the portal itself. The old entry here also
# listed `packages/design-agent-skills/skills/` and described the Supabase
# `skills` table as canonical — both wrong now: that directory no longer exists
# and skills are files in `nyuchi/mzizi-tools` (CLAUDE.md §15.23).
.claude/skills/*.md
!.claude/skills/README.md

# Registry component snapshots — components/ui/*.tsx are generated from the
# Supabase `components` source_code by `pnpm registry:sync` (see CLAUDE.md 8.4)
# and overwritten on every sync. Prettier-formatting them drifts them from the
# generated output and breaks `registry:verify`; leave them as the sync emits.
components/ui/

